@base = https://localhost:7081
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshToken = REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN
@recipientWalletId = REPLACE_WITH_BOB_WALLET_ID
@password = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DEMO_PASSWORD

### Login (after demo seeding)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.test","password":"{{password}}"}

### Own wallet
GET {{base}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transfer. Repeat with the SAME key and payload to replay safely.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipientWalletId":"{{recipientWalletId}}","amount":500.00}

### History
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rotate refresh token ONCE; replace both saved tokens with the response.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Logout
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Database readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready


### Register a real test address; read the verification email before login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"you@example.com","password":"Your-Strong-Password-239!"}

### Confirm email using the code from App_Data/mail or your SMTP inbox
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/confirm-email
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"you@example.com","token":"REPLACE_WITH_EMAIL_CODE"}

### Request recovery (always a generic accepted response)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"you@example.com"}

### Reset password and invalidate all existing sessions
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"you@example.com","token":"REPLACE_WITH_RESET_CODE","newPassword":"Changed-Strong-Password-239!"}

### Active own sessions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout all sessions
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtered history
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?kind=Transfer&direction=outgoing&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Operator reconciliation
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Begin MFA enrollment (copy the shared key to a trusted authenticator app)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/mfa/enrollment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"{{password}}"}

### Confirm enrollment; save returned recovery codes and sign in again with the NEXT code
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/mfa/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"REPLACE_WITH_SIX_DIGITS"}

### MFA login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.test","password":"{{password}}","authenticatorCode":"REPLACE_WITH_SIX_DIGITS"}

### Recent-MFA step-up
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/mfa/step-up
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"{{password}}","authenticatorCode":"REPLACE_WITH_NEW_CODE"}

### Operator A requests unfreezing; a DIFFERENT operator must approve
POST {{base}}/api/v1/operations/wallets/{{recipientWalletId}}/unfreeze-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"{{password}}","reason":"Customer review completed"}
